---
// LAB de diseño de Grupo Spazi Monterrey - direccion "Nocturno refinado".
// Pagina autocontenida, sin indexar. No comparte estilos con el sitio real.
// Navy protagonista, glassmorphism, gold + naranja como luz. Estilo Linear/Vercel de noche.
// No tocar el sitio real hasta que Roberto apruebe una direccion aqui.
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es-MX">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
  <title>Lab · Nocturno refinado · Grupo Spazi Monterrey</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      /* Paleta Spazi, viva. Navy manda, gold acompaña, naranja enciende. */
      --navy:        #0C2554;
      --navy-deep:   #0A1B3D;
      --navy-mid:    #1B3A6B;
      --gold:        #C8A84B;
      --gold-bright: #E4C15A;
      --orange:      #EC6B2D;
      --orange-soft: #F4A46B;
      --cream:       #F7F3EA;
      --paper:       #FBF9F3;
      --ink:         #12203B;
      --muted:       #5C6A80;
      --line:        #E4DECF;
      --white:       #FFFFFF;

      /* Derivados nocturnos: superficies y bordes translucidos (HIG deferencia) */
      --bg:          #081228;
      --bg-2:        #0A1B3D;
      --surface:     rgba(255,255,255,.045);
      --surface-2:   rgba(255,255,255,.07);
      --glass-line:  rgba(255,255,255,.10);
      --glass-line-2:rgba(255,255,255,.16);
      --text:        #EAF0FA;
      --text-2:      rgba(234,240,250,.72);
      --text-3:      rgba(234,240,250,.48);

      --r-sm: 8px;
      --r-md: 12px;
      --r-lg: 16px;
      --r-xl: 22px;
      --maxw: 1120px;
      --ease: cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.22,1);
      --space: 8px;
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Manrope', system-ui, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
      background:
        radial-gradient(1200px 700px at 78% -8%, rgba(28,58,107,.55), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(900px 600px at 8% 12%, rgba(12,37,84,.5), transparent 55%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-2) 0%, var(--bg) 55%, #060d1e 100%);
      background-attachment: fixed;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    /* Mesh sutil de fondo, animado, cubre toda la pagina */
    .mesh {
      position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(200,168,75,.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(200,168,75,.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 46px 46px;
      mask-image: radial-gradient(1100px 700px at 70% 0%, #000 0%, transparent 70%);
      animation: meshDrift 26s linear infinite;
    }
    @keyframes meshDrift { from { background-position: 0 0, 0 0; } to { background-position: 46px 92px, 46px 92px; } }

    .wrap { max-width: var(--maxw); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }

    a { color: inherit; }

    /* ============ Barra sticky ============ */
    .lab-bar {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 60;
      background: rgba(8,18,40,.62);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(140%);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(140%);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-line);
    }
    .lab-bar-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 56px; gap: 1rem; }
    .lab-bar .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .7rem; }
    .lab-bar .tag { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .7rem; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold-bright); }
    .lab-bar .dir { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .68rem; letter-spacing: .1em; color: var(--text-3); padding-left: .7rem; border-left: 1px solid var(--glass-line); }
    .lab-bar a.back { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .72rem; color: var(--text-2); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: .03em; transition: color .2s var(--ease); }
    .lab-bar a.back:hover { color: var(--gold-bright); }

    /* ============ Estructura del lab ============ */
    .lab-section { padding: 88px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-line); }
    .lab-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 40px; }
    .lab-num { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .74rem; color: var(--orange); letter-spacing: .12em; padding-top: .35rem; }
    .lab-title { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.1rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .lab-note { font-size: .95rem; color: var(--text-2); max-width: 64ch; margin-top: .5rem; }

    .kicker { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold-bright); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem; }
    .kicker::before { content: ''; width: 26px; height: 1.5px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), var(--orange)); }

    /* ============ Intro ============ */
    .intro { padding-top: 76px; }
    .intro .d1 { font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 7vw, 4.6rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.0; letter-spacing: -.035em; margin: 1.3rem 0 1rem; }
    .intro .d1 em { font-style: normal; background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--gold-bright), var(--orange)); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; }
    .intro .thesis { font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--text-2); max-width: 56ch; font-weight: 500; }

    /* ============ 1. Tokens ============ */
    .swatches { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(158px,1fr)); gap: 14px; }
    .sw {
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-line); border-radius: var(--r-md); overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--surface); backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
      transition: transform .3s var(--ease), border-color .3s var(--ease);
    }
    .sw:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: var(--glass-line-2); }
    .sw .chip { height: 80px; box-shadow: inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.15); }
    .sw .meta { padding: .65rem .75rem; }
    .sw .name { font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 600; }
    .sw .hex { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .72rem; color: var(--text-3); margin-top: .1rem; }

    /* ============ 2. Tipografia ============ */
    .type-row { padding: 1.15rem 0; border-top: 1px dashed var(--glass-line); }
    .type-row:first-child { border-top: none; }
    .type-label { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .68rem; color: var(--text-3); letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
    .t-display { font-size: clamp(2.2rem,5.5vw,3.6rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
    .t-display em { font-style: normal; color: var(--gold-bright); }
    .t-h2 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .t-body { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-2); max-width: 64ch; font-weight: 400; }
    .t-spec { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .85rem; color: var(--gold-bright); letter-spacing: .02em; }

    /* ============ 3. Firma ============ */
    .signature {
      position: relative; border-radius: var(--r-xl); overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-line);
      background:
        radial-gradient(600px 300px at 20% 0%, rgba(28,58,107,.6), transparent 60%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,27,61,.9), rgba(6,13,30,.9));
      padding: 44px;
      min-height: 320px;
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 320px; gap: 2.5rem; align-items: center;
    }
    .signature .sig-grid {
      position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(200,168,75,.09) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(200,168,75,.09) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 34px 34px;
      mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 78% 60%, #000 30%, transparent 78%);
    }
    .sig-copy { position: relative; }
    .sig-copy h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.02em; margin-bottom: .6rem; }
    .sig-copy p { color: var(--text-2); font-size: .95rem; max-width: 42ch; }

    /* Panel de estado en vivo - glass */
    .status-panel {
      position: relative;
      background: var(--surface-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-line-2);
      border-radius: var(--r-lg);
      padding: 1.4rem;
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
    }
    .status-panel .sp-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 1.1rem; }
    .status-panel .sp-title { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .68rem; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-3); }
    .orb { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .66rem; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--gold-bright); }
    .orb .dot { position: relative; width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--orange); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(236,107,45,.6); animation: orbPulse 2.2s ease-out infinite; }
    @keyframes orbPulse { 0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(236,107,45,.55); } 70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 12px rgba(236,107,45,0); } 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(236,107,45,0); } }
    .sp-row { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: .55rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-line); font-size: .82rem; }
    .sp-row:first-of-type { border-top: none; }
    .sp-row .k { color: var(--text-3); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .04em; }
    .sp-row .v { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
    .sp-row .v.on { color: var(--gold-bright); }

    /* Micro-demos */
    .demos { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px,1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-top: 26px; }
    .demo-mini { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--glass-line); border-radius: var(--r-md); padding: 1.3rem; text-align: center; }
    .demo-mini .cap { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .64rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em; color: var(--text-3); margin-top: .9rem; }
    .demo-mini .big-count { font-size: 2.8rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.03em; color: var(--gold-bright); line-height: 1; }
    .lift-tile { height: 74px; border-radius: var(--r-sm); background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy-mid), var(--navy)); border: 1px solid var(--glass-line-2); display: grid; place-items: center; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .72rem; color: var(--text-2); transition: transform .3s var(--ease), box-shadow .3s var(--ease); }
    .lift-tile:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); box-shadow: 0 16px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.4); }

    /* ============ Botones ============ */
    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .55rem; font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: .92rem; padding: .82rem 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--r-md); border: 1px solid transparent; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; transition: transform .25s var(--ease), box-shadow .25s var(--ease), background .25s var(--ease); }
    .btn svg { width: 17px; height: 17px; }
    .btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--orange), #d85a1f); color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(236,107,45,.32); }
    .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(236,107,45,.44); }
    .btn-gold { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold-bright), var(--gold)); color: #1a1405; box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(200,168,75,.26); }
    .btn-gold:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(200,168,75,.4); }
    .btn-ghost { background: rgba(255,255,255,.04); color: var(--text); border-color: var(--glass-line-2); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
    .btn-ghost:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: var(--gold-bright); color: var(--gold-bright); }
    .btn-wa { background: #1FA855; color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(31,168,85,.28); }
    .btn-wa:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: #22b85d; box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(31,168,85,.4); }

    /* ============ 4. Componentes ============ */
    .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px,1fr)); gap: 18px; }
    .demo { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--glass-line); border-radius: var(--r-lg); padding: 1.7rem; backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
    .demo h4 { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .68rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; color: var(--text-3); margin-bottom: 1.1rem; }

    .chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .55rem; }
    .spec-chip { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .72rem; padding: .35rem .8rem; border: 1px solid var(--glass-line); border-radius: 100px; color: var(--text-2); background: rgba(255,255,255,.03); }
    .spec-chip b { color: var(--gold-bright); font-weight: 600; }

    .scard { background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(27,58,107,.28), rgba(255,255,255,.02)); border: 1px solid var(--glass-line); border-radius: var(--r-md); padding: 1.5rem; transition: transform .3s var(--ease), border-color .3s var(--ease), box-shadow .3s var(--ease); }
    .scard:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); border-color: var(--glass-line-2); box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.34); }
    .scard .ico { width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: var(--r-sm); background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy-mid), var(--navy-deep)); border: 1px solid var(--glass-line-2); color: var(--gold-bright); display: grid; place-items: center; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .scard h5 { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.01em; margin-bottom: .35rem; }
    .scard p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--text-2); }

    .stat { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .stat .n { font-size: 2.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.03em; color: var(--text); }
    .stat .n sup { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .95rem; color: var(--orange); vertical-align: super; font-weight: 500; }
    .stat .l { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .68rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em; color: var(--text-3); margin-top: .55rem; }
    .stat-row { display: flex; gap: 3rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    .quote { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--glass-line); border-left: 3px solid var(--orange); border-radius: var(--r-md); padding: 1.6rem; backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
    .quote p { font-size: 1.08rem; color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.55; }
    .quote .who { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .15rem; }
    .quote .who b { font-size: .92rem; font-weight: 700; }
    .quote .who span { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .68rem; color: var(--text-3); letter-spacing: .06em; }

    /* ============ 5. En contexto ============ */
    .ctx { border: 1px solid var(--glass-line); border-radius: var(--r-xl); overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 2rem; box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.4); }
    .ctx-tag { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .66rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; color: var(--text-3); padding: .65rem 1.1rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,.03); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-line); }

    /* Hero nocturno */
    .hero { position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 0; }
    .hero-inner { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr; gap: 0; min-height: 560px; }
    .hero-copy { position: relative; padding: 56px 48px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; z-index: 2;
      background:
        radial-gradient(700px 500px at 0% 0%, rgba(28,58,107,.5), transparent 60%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,27,61,.94), rgba(6,13,30,.96)); }
    .hero-grid-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 1;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(200,168,75,.06) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(200,168,75,.06) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 40px 40px;
      mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 15% 25%, #000, transparent 65%); }
    .hero-copy h1 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.3vw, 3.5rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.03; letter-spacing: -.035em; margin: 1.3rem 0 1.1rem; }
    .hero-copy h1 em { font-style: normal; background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--gold-bright), var(--orange)); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; }
    .hero-copy p { color: var(--text-2); max-width: 46ch; margin-bottom: 1.8rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: .8rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 2.2rem; }
    .hero-metrics { display: flex; gap: 2.4rem; flex-wrap: wrap; padding-top: 1.6rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-line); }
    .hero-photo { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .hero-photo img { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
    .hero-photo .scrim { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(6,13,30,.96) 0%, rgba(6,13,30,.4) 30%, rgba(6,13,30,.1) 70%), linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(6,13,30,.7), transparent 40%); }
    .hero-photo .float-orb { position: absolute; top: 22px; right: 22px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .64rem; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--text); background: rgba(8,18,40,.6); border: 1px solid var(--glass-line-2); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); padding: .4rem .7rem; border-radius: 100px; z-index: 2; }
    .hero-photo .float-orb .dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--gold-bright); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(228,193,90,.6); animation: orbPulse 2.2s ease-out infinite; }
    .hero-photo .spec-badge { position: absolute; left: 22px; bottom: 22px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .64rem; letter-spacing: .06em; color: var(--gold-bright); background: rgba(8,18,40,.62); border: 1px solid var(--glass-line); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); padding: .45rem .75rem; border-radius: var(--r-sm); z-index: 2; }

    /* Segunda seccion: grid de servicios */
    .services-band { background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,27,61,.7), rgba(6,13,30,.85)); padding: 52px 48px; }
    .services-band .sb-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .services-band h2 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem,2.6vw,2rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .services-band .sb-sub { color: var(--text-2); font-size: .95rem; max-width: 40ch; }
    .svc-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px,1fr)); gap: 16px; }

    /* ============ Footer ============ */
    .lab-foot { padding: 44px 0 68px; text-align: center; }
    .lab-foot p { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: .72rem; color: var(--text-3); letter-spacing: .06em; }

    /* ============ Reveal ============ */
    .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); transition: opacity .7s var(--ease), transform .7s var(--ease); }
    .reveal.in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      * { animation: none !important; }
      .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; }
    }

    /* ============ Responsive ============ */
    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .signature { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero-photo { min-height: 300px; order: -1; }
      .hero-photo .scrim { background: linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(6,13,30,.96), rgba(6,13,30,.2) 60%); }
      .services-band, .hero-copy { padding: 40px 24px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .lab-section { padding: 60px 0; }
      .lab-bar .dir { display: none; }
      .stat-row { gap: 2rem; }
      .hero-metrics { gap: 1.6rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="mesh"></div>

  <!-- Barra sticky -->
  <div class="lab-bar">
    <div class="wrap lab-bar-inner">
      <span class="brand">
        <span class="tag">Spazi · Lab</span>
        <span class="dir">Nocturno refinado</span>
      </span>
      <a class="back" href="/lab">← Todas las direcciones</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="lab-section intro">
    <div class="wrap reveal">
      <span class="kicker">Dirección de diseño</span>
      <h1 class="d1">Nocturno <em>refinado</em></h1>
      <p class="thesis">Navy protagonista, premium y sobrio. La oscuridad da seriedad de ingeniería; el gold y el naranja son la luz que la enciende. Vidrio, profundidad y motion con propósito: se siente caro porque está trabajado.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 1. Tokens -->
  <section class="lab-section" id="tokens">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="lab-head reveal">
        <span class="lab-num">01</span>
        <div>
          <h2 class="lab-title">Tokens de color</h2>
          <p class="lab-note">Navy en tres profundidades como base. Gold para prestigio, naranja para energía y acción. Crema y papel se reservan para superficies claras puntuales. Nada de plano: cada acento pesa.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
